@startuml er-processador
!include ../_estilo.iuml

title Banco do processador

hide circle
skinparam linetype ortho

entity merchants {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * subject_id : text <<UK>>
  * display_name : text
  * identity_store_id : uuid <<FK>>
  wallet_id : uuid
  wallet_masked : text
  pix_key_id : uuid
  pix_key_masked : text
  webhook_url : text
  webhook_secret : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity payments {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * merchant_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * direction : text
  * amount_brl_minor : bigint
  * status : text
  * collection_reference : text <<UK>>
  * collection_instructions : text
  quote_eth_wei : numeric(78,0)
  quote_expires_at : timestamptz
  hold_release_at : timestamptz
  med_status : text
  * idempotency_key : text
  * request_hash : text
  * expires_at : timestamptz
  * version : bigint
  * created_at : timestamptz
  .. UK (merchant_id, idempotency_key) ..
}

entity transactions {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * payment_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * kind : text
  * external_id : text
  * amount_minor : numeric(78,0)
  * asset : text
  * occurred_at : timestamptz
  .. UK (kind, external_id) ..
}

entity jobs {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * type : text
  payment_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * dedup_key : text <<UK>>
  * payload : jsonb
  * status : text
  * attempts : int
  * run_at : timestamptz
  last_error : text
}

entity identity_stores {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * base_url : text
  * status : text
  enrollment_token_hash : text
  enrollment_expires_at : timestamptz
  certificate_serial : text
  certificate_not_after : timestamptz
}

entity chain_cursor {
  * chain_id : bigint <<PK>>
  --
  * last_block : bigint
}

identity_stores ||--o{ merchants
merchants ||--o{ payments
payments ||--o{ transactions
payments |o--o{ jobs

note right of jobs
  Fila de tarefas e deduplicação ao mesmo tempo:
  • workers buscam com FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;
  • dedup_key único descarta eventos repetidos
    (pix:{endToEndId}, eth:{txHash}:{logIndex},
    webhook:{paymentId}:{status}).
end note

note bottom of payments
  Idempotency-Key repetida com o mesmo request_hash
  devolve o pagamento existente; com outro, erro 422.
  med_status: nulo, OPEN, RECOVERED, NOT_RECOVERABLE
  ou CLOSED.
end note

note bottom of merchants
  Dados pessoais ficam fora: nome, CPF/CNPJ, chave
  Pix e carteira estão no IdentityStore (mesmo id
  do lojista; wallet_id e pix_key_id apontam para
  lá) e o e-mail de acesso no Keycloak (subject_id). webhook_secret fica
  cifrado com chave em Kubernetes Secret.
end note
@enduml
